WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.925
Symbols, formulas and models each show something different.

2
00:00:04.775 --> 00:00:07.900
In these ball models, each ball is an atom.

3
00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:15.067
Water. The formula H two O says: two hydrogen atoms, one oxygen.

4
00:00:17.297 --> 00:00:22.347
C O two: one carbon and two oxygen. The model shows how they join.

5
00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:27.448
A formula is quick to write; a model shows the arrangement.
